; A local grid: two bare fixes and no *cs anywhere. CaveWhere places the
; first fix, p1, at the project origin and translates the file with it,
; so p9 keeps its offset from p1 and every leg keeps its shape.
*begin grid
*fix p1 812345.25 4123456.75 210
*data normal from to tape compass clino
p1 p2 25 45 -5
p2 p3 30 120 10
*fix p9 812400 4123400 200
p9 p10 12 270 0
*end grid
